@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
+<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0 -->
+
 # Stage 1 — Input
 
 **Position in lifecycle:** first stage. Nothing precedes it.
diff --git a/ai-coding/parameters/generated/lifecycle/2-plan.md b/ai-coding/parameters/generated/lifecycle/2-plan.md
index 781dbee..1503a1c 100644
--- a/ai-coding/parameters/generated/lifecycle/2-plan.md
+++ b/ai-coding/parameters/generated/lifecycle/2-plan.md
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
+<!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0 -->
+
